  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Developers using NuxtIdentity need a way to pre-populate ASP.NET Identity tables (users, roles, claims, and their associations) and NuxtIdentity-owned tables (invitations) from configuration at application startup. Today, each consumer writes ad-hoc seeding code, leading to duplicated boilerplate and inconsistent approaches. A reusable, configuration-driven seeding component would eliminate this duplication and provide a consistent, well-tested pattern across all environments. See #29",
